smartclockmon (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * First release.  Library, logging daemon, terminal monitor, one-shot
    CLI and a simulated receiver for HP / Symmetricom SmartClock GPS
    time and frequency receivers.
  * Verified against a 58503A running firmware 3704-C.

